      481.73
    ],
    "text": "Imposing of Entertainment Taxes by the Kandy Municipal Council",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      497.31,
      540.06,
      527.79
    ],
    "text": "The following resolution passed by the Kandy Municipal Council under decision No. 8 (23) at the General Meeting held on 20.12.2018in terms of Sub - section (I) of Section 2 of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance (Chapter 267) has been approved by the Hon. Governor ofthe Central Province in terms of Sub - section (2) of that Section and is hereby published in terms of that Sub - Section.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.879112243652344
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      438.72,
      546.32,
      527.16,
      556.4
    ],
    "text": "MAITHREE GUNARATNE,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      558.32,
      517.53,
      604.4
    ],
    "text": "Hon. Governor,Central Province.At Governor\u2019s Office,On this 22nd day of April, 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      264.0,
      618.55,
      323.87,
      627.43
    ],
    "text": "RESOLUTION",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.879112243652344
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      640.11,
      540.4,
      692.19
    ],
    "text": "In accordance with Section 2 (1) of the Entertainment Tax ordinance and Entertainment Tax (Amended) Act, No. 37 of 1984, the KandyMunicipal Council hereby resolves to impose and levy an entertainment Tax equivalent to 25% of the face value of entry tickets for everymagic show, circus, horse show, musical show, exhibition match, carnival and any other event where a fee is charged and an entertainmenttax equivalent to 7.5% of the face value of entry tickets to films in cinemas hed in the area within the administrative limits of the KandyMunicipal Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.879112243652344
    ]
  },
